sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CLI as CLI
    participant Host as Host Services
    participant VM as Firecracker VM
    participant Agent as Agent

    User->>CLI: primordial run <agent>
    CLI->>Host: Resolve repo + validate manifest
    CLI->>User: Show permissions
    User-->>CLI: Approve

    CLI->>Host: Decrypt API keys from vault
    CLI->>Host: Create git worktree

    CLI->>VM: Create sandbox
    Note over VM: Harden VM · start proxy

    CLI->>VM: Upload workspace snapshot
    CLI->>Agent: Start agent process
    Agent-->>CLI: ready

    loop Conversation
        User->>CLI: message
        CLI->>Agent: NDJSON message
        Agent->>VM: API call via proxy
        VM-->>Agent: response
        Agent-->>CLI: activity + response
        CLI-->>User: result
    end

    User->>CLI: exit
    CLI->>Agent: shutdown

    opt workspace: readwrite
        CLI->>VM: capture git diff
        VM-->>CLI: patch
        CLI->>Host: apply to worktree
        CLI-->>User: review commands
    end

    CLI->>VM: destroy
